# System & Network Inspector

A simple Python tool that analyzes system and network activity.

## Features

- Displays system information (user, OS, hostname)
- Shows CPU and RAM usage
- Lists running processes
- Displays network information (IP, hostname)
- Shows active network connections
- Detects unusual ports (basic security check)

## Technologies Used

- Python
- psutil
- socket
- platform

